---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 text-sm leading-relaxed">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Terms of Service</h1>

  <p class="text-gray-400 mb-4">Last updated: 2025</p>

  <section class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-400">
      By using Ironlox, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, do not use the service.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">2. Service Description</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-400">
      Ironlox is a zero-knowledge password manager. All vault data is encrypted on your device
      before transmission. We cannot access your plaintext data under any circumstances.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">3. User Responsibilities</h2>
    <ul class="text-gray-400 mt-3 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
      <li>You are responsible for safeguarding your master password. We cannot reset it.</li>
      <li>Maintain accurate account information.</li>
      <li>Do not use the service for illegal activities.</li>
      <li>Export your data periodically as a backup.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">4. Free and Premium Tiers</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-400">
      The free tier provides core password management features. Premium features
      (TOTP 2FA, attachments, vault health reports) require a paid subscription.
      Premium features are forfeited on downgrade to free tier.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-400">
      Ironlox is provided "as is" without warranty. We are not liable for damages
      arising from use of the service, including data loss. You are responsible for
      maintaining backups of critical passwords.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">6. Contact</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-400">
      For legal inquiries, contact
      <a href="mailto:legal@ironlox.com" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">legal@ironlox.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</main>
